OS Golden Gate. Tra le novità: Siri AI in stile chatbot, miglioramenti di interfaccia e strumenti AI in Foto, Safari, Password e Image Playground.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/macOS-27-next-to-MacBook-Pro-Running-macOS-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-27-next-to-MacBook-Pro-Running-macOS-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null}],\"totalPages\":22}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":3600,"tags":["tj-posts"]}